// Level 0 - Mensa, foyer, kitchen, Audimax
// elevation 0.0 m, height 4.5 m
// Mensa with a curved, fully glazed bulge towards the campus square (south),
// glazed entrance foyer under the atrium, kitchen with servery counters, and
// the fan-shaped Audimax (double height, 8.5 m) with raked seating tiers.

